# This repository is the canonical SOURCE for skills that are deployed
# byte-for-byte into two runtimes, and manifests/skills.json records the
# expected SHA-256 of each file. Git's core.autocrlf would rewrite line endings
# on commit, so a fresh clone would no longer match those hashes and
# scripts/deploy-skills.py would report permanent phantom drift.
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion. Do not remove it.
* -text
